  "description": "This city bad boy gets even badder with a ground-up redesign. Elegantly aggressive style, forward-thinking features, external gearing and grippy tires makes this year BOOZ ultimate sub urban ride. With its sporty geometry and fat (but fast!) tires you can charge across the city, hopping over curbs, not giving a f*&c about potholes or the condition of the pavements. The flat bar gives you tons of control, and the Twintip fork will let you adjust the attitude of the bike to suits your preference - lower, more twitchy, or higher and more stable. External, reliable SRAM NX1 drivetrain for more versatile on and off road usage. And just look at those lines and the combination of the beautiful CroMo frame and unique fork!",
